  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroManager
  introLines:
  - It has been fourteen days since LeBron James vanished without a trace, leaving
    the world of basketball in chaos.
  - "Now, on the eve of the NBA Finals, you\u2014Lebron''s all star teammate\u2014wake
    up to find yourself paralyzed."
  - "The opposing head coach has something sinister in mind. He\u2019s cast a dark
    binding spell on you. He will go to any length to win."
  - You have been trapped in a mystical realm.
  - You have until tip-off to break the curse and make it to the game
  - "Press A / D to Move Left & Right \n\nPress W/Space to Jump\n\nPress T to toggle
    aim line\n\nPressUp/Down arrow to adjust aim\n\nPress Enter to shoot and hold
    Enter to pull the ball back."
  nextSceneName: Level_01
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  backspaceSpeed: 0.03
  lineDelay: 2
